    "sections": {
        "description": "Wira is a lightweight, SEO-friendly multipurpose WordPress theme built for business websites, fully compatible with Elementor and Gutenberg. Designed for speed, responsiveness, and easy customization, Wira includes a sticky header, transparent overlay header, off-canvas mobile menu, smooth scroll-to-top button, and modern responsive layout. Optimized for fast loading, Core Web Vitals, and search engine visibility, Wira is developer-friendly and perfect for company profiles, agencies, startups, portfolios, corporate websites, and landing pages."
